Starpath", "keywords": ["PvP", "Free", "Multiplayer", "Starpath", "FPS"], "long_description": "After enlisting to join the fight to counter Union of Colonies in their reign of terror, you and your squad members are stuck in a sandstorm and running out of time.\nEDP:Starpath picks up the story of EDP:Wayfarer in a fast paced Online FPS offering full body presence, free movement and arsenal of 5 weapons to take on PvP to determine who reigns supreme.", "short_description": "EDP:Starpath is a fast paced, immersive Online FPS based on EarthDefenceProgram universe. It offers full body presence, free movement and an arsenal of 5 weapons, to introduce a world first in it\u00b4s own genre. Developed by VR veteran at RefineRealityLtd."}]}, "developer_name": "Refine Reality Ltd.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.refinereality.com/RefineRealityPrivacyPolicy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Refine Reality Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.refinereality.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1162857724119171"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_453222718537066_4124645278340874240_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qQ9YzD4EaYoQ7kNvwFYIc8u&_nc_oc=Adq3M5XF9ZftTfwvlhgr8MBGblVlCwuTplZkfLSiVw7MS2gfxpMMJhs-S3_h_00fc1A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscd